# Diagnostics' unit tests: the page holds still while they run and stays
# up as it comes back (v0.3.2: it went black for 2 frames), every frame
# hashed until past the redraw's end ("page back").
# Diagnostics from L+R+SELECT held at power-on (B17 moves it to Info), A
# once its first page is up and those keys are let go
-k 1:L+R+SELECT
-w "screen ready: diag-start"
-k 60:-
-k @40:A -k @44:-
-w "TESTS DONE"
-H @0:@12
-w "diag: page back after the unit tests"
-s @4:back.png
